e Boston market\u2019s multifamily construction with Berkadia\u2019s pipeline reports for the fourth quarter of 2023 . Stay ahead of the game and remain up to date on the latest developments in new construction projects, whether they are currently under construction, planned, or proposed in your local market. This detailed [\u2026]"], [3, "An Update on the New Construction Pipeline - ALN Apartment Data\nJun 11, 2024 \u00b7 With the possible exception of the Los Angeles area, none of the top ten markets for upcoming new supply are likely to get annual net absorption close enough to annual new supply in 2024 to maintain current average occupancy. Los Angeles presents an interesting case because demand has rebounded particularly well there this year."], [4, "Boston 3Q 2024 Market Report \u2013 MMG Real Estate Advisors\nDemand in Boston has been on the rise, with net absorption outpacing new deliveries in all three quarters of 2024 . While absorption rates have increased over the past year, new completions have slowed, leading to tighter rental market conditions."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": null}, "prompt_chain": null, "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["boston", "los angeles", "new hampshire", "commercial real estate", "real estate market", "market report", "construction pipeline", "property development", "multifamily housing", "apartment market", "rental market", "housing supply", "housing demand", "leasing activity", "vacancy rate", "net absorption", "occupancy rates", "rental prices", "industrial real estate", "warehouse space"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
