 "Xcel Energy proposes $1.9B wildfire mitigation plan in ...\nJul 2, 2024 \u00b7 Xcel Energy on Thursday filed a $1.9 billion wildfire mitigation plan with the Colorado Public Utilities Commission that includes adding hundreds of weather stations near power lines, updating ..."], [2, "Wildfire mitigation plan proposed by Xcel Energy gets green light\nJun 11, 2025 \u00b7 The Marshall Fire on January 8, 2024 . Courtesy: NOAA The Colorado Public Utilities Commission (PUC) has verbally approved Xcel Energy \u2019s Wildfire Mitigation Plan, outlining specific goals and reporting methods to better communicate the company\u2019s ongoing wildfire mitigation work with customers and communities."]], "participants": null}}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "ner_001", "crc": 1321322, "title": "Extract named entities from documents", "name": "extract_named_entities", "description": "Identifies and extracts named entities from provided documents.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "ner", "prompt_template": "Extract all named entities from the provided document. Include the following entity types: PERSON, ORGANIZATION, LOCATION, and any other relevant entities. Return as comma-delimited list of entities with their types (e.g., 'John Smith (PERSON), ACM Corp (ORGANIZATION)). Only return the entities without any additional commentary.", "output_variable": "extracted_entities", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["xcel energy", "colorado public utilities commission", "colorado", "wildfire mitigation plan", "marshall fire", "noaa", "transportation and infrastructure committee", "shontel lewis", "chris hinds", "flor alvidrez", "kevin flynn", "stacie gilmore", "paul kashmann", "amanda sandoval", "council bill 26-0565", "drmc chapter 10 article xiv", "high-performance existing buildings program", "council bill 26-0563", "atis elevator inspections llc", "msci"], "vectors": null}, "